Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.87,0:00:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.39,0:00:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Your moves!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.53,0:01:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,This is impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.53,0:01:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Their power is equal!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.99,0:01:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,He withstood the assault\Nof an Egyptian god!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.11,0:01:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,But had I not acquired the attacking\Npower of Kaiba's Blue Eyes,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.69,0:01:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,my Deerbound would have been destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.75,0:01:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd best be taking my leave for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.39,0:01:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't over, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.87,0:01:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,And you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.07,0:01:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe it's Mahad.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.91,0:01:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't grow too fond of\Nthat item around your neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.99,0:01:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a special, shall we say,\Nattachment to the Millennium Ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.95,0:01:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,At one time, it was mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.93,0:01:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,This item was created for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.31,0:01:54.59,Default,,0,0,0,,So you lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.67,0:01:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,But it is destined for me. In\Nfact, all seven Millennium Items.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.51,0:02:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,have been fated to fall into\Nmy hands just you wait stop
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.63,0:02:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,We mustn't let him escape!\NGod, after him! Yes, master.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.13,0:02:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't contain me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.73,0:02:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Till we meet again!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.41,0:02:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,So I was sent back in time to\Nrelive these events all over again?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.95,0:02:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Shimon, tell me, what is\Nthat strange object in
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.63,0:02:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The sky? What do you mean,\Nup there? That pyramid.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.27,0:02:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry your excellency I don't see\Nanything but it's right there in plain sight
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.13,0:03:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Pharaoh let's go in it's\Nbeen a long day very well I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.91,0:03:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,sure it has something to do\Nwith Bakura's Shadow game,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.93,0:03:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,but why can no one else see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.17,0:03:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he truly the chosen pharaoh\Nthe scriptures speak of?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.27,0:03:22.23,Default,,0,0,0,,My king, you fought bravely.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.43,0:03:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, thanks to you we can all rest well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.55,0:03:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,If only Kaiba were able to see\Nhimself fighting boldly by my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.37,0:03:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't these people see\Nthis is only a card game?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.61,0:03:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you looking at?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.67,0:03:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I'm going to\Nlet you change my mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.01,0:03:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I am not flying to Egypt.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.47,0:03:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.75,0:03:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm talking to some\Ngolden antique eyeball.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.77,0:03:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on. What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.57,0:04:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.15,0:04:07.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.07,0:04:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been hearing about this ancient\Nnonsense for too long. And the only
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.39,0:04:24.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Way to shut these people up is to\Nprove them all wrong. This is KC-1,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.75,0:04:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,setting course for Cairo, Egypt
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.83,0:04:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Any word on Bakura?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.99,0:04:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,With an entire squadron of guards on\Nhis trail, he will not get far Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.01,0:04:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,After seeing his frighteningly\Nimpressive display of power, I disagree.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.23,0:04:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.55,0:04:46.05,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not dealing with any ordinary thief.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.39,0:04:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,He's harboring a creature with a strength\Nthat rivals that of the Egyptian gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.49,0:04:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.40,0:04:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Ak-Nadin, you have\Njust given me an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.23,0:04:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,This tablet sanctuary is full of creatures
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.05,0:05:00.25,Default,,0,0,0,,we've pulled from the hearts of criminals.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.33,0:05:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely there must be other evildoers\Nharboring as much darkness as this Bakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.29,0:05:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,wouldn't you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.55,0:05:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I would.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.09,0:05:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Your king wanted power.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.05,0:05:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why he devised a plan to use the\Nseven items to control the entire world.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.87,0:05:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,The secret lies in the\Nvillage of Kal Elna.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.47,0:05:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps Bakura escaped from that\Nvillage before it was destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.39,0:05:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,That would explain the incredible power\Nof the beast that dwells within him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.81,0:05:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,For his anger and hatred\Nwould be immeasurable.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.03,0:05:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,All we need to do is find these criminals.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.57,0:05:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we simply use the\NMillennium Items to harness
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.61,0:05:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,the evil creatures that\Ndwell within their hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.31,0:05:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we'll have an unstoppable\Narmy of Shadow Monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.99,0:05:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto, what you're suggesting is completely\Nimmoral, not to mention quite dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.93,0:05:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,With all due respect, Master,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.03,0:05:54.55,Default,,0,0,0,,would we not be reducing\Nthe amount of Lawbreakers
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.63,0:05:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,that wreak havoc on\Nthis kingdom every day?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.91,0:05:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps. And in the end,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.53,0:06:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,we would be creating this monster army\Nin order to protect the people of Egypt.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.57,0:06:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that not what we all\Npromised to do the day we
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.37,0:06:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,took our oath as the sacred\Nguardians of the pharaoh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.57,0:06:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Millennium Necklace, show\Nme what dangers lie ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.29,0:06:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.71,0:06:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since Bakura arrived, my vision\Nof the future has been clouded.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.85,0:06:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It's as if the kingdom is\Nshrouded in a blanket of shadows.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.37,0:06:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,But I must continue my efforts\Nto see through the darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.85,0:06:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You should preserve your energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.83,0:06:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,This evening's battle with Bakura has\Ntaken its toll on all of us, Isis.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.75,0:06:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,When he returns, we will need our\Nfull power in order to face him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.53,0:06:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,So listen to Shaddaa and get some rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.91,0:06:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I appreciate your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.57,0:07:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Both of you,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.01,0:07:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,but my Millennium Necklace may be our only
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.49,0:07:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,hope of knowing what\NBakura is plotting next.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.51,0:07:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Since the well-being of the\Ncitizens of Egypt is at stake,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.11,0:07:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid rest is a\Nluxury I can't afford.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.93,0:07:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,If I'm unable to save mankind from\Nthe evil that's about to unfold,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.79,0:07:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,what will become of the future?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.25,0:07:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The safety of my friends\Ndepends upon my victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.13,0:07:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, I'll do whatever\NI can to protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.05,0:07:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Every doorway in this\Nplace looks the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.03,0:07:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,No joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.39,0:07:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll never find the right one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.79,0:07:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,And every time I open one,\NI find 50 more of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.25,0:07:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Even the doors have doors?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.75,0:07:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey guys,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.66,0:07:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,either the batteries on my watch just\Ndied or time is somehow standing still.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.99,0:07:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.29,0:07:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, she's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.37,0:08:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Dudes, this place is\Nstarting to freak me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.97,0:08:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,If we don't find the Pharaoh\Nsoon, I'm gonna lose it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.67,0:08:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.81,0:08:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the one!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.81,0:08:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have a Millennium\Nthingy, but I do have instincts.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.83,0:08:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I say we bust that\Nsucker down on three! Three!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.33,0:08:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.19,0:08:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Pharaoh, here we come!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.61,0:08:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,So much for your instincts!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.23,0:08:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.14,0:08:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,How can they be up there and down here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.61,0:08:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's ask questions later.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.77,0:08:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.68,0:08:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Many doorways within the chasms of\Nthe Millennium Puzzle contain traps.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.53,0:08:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You might want to tell\Nus that sooner next time!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.89,0:08:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Many doorways contain traps.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.47,0:08:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought he was supposed\Nto find this doorway for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.33,0:08:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.79,0:08:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no one who's closer to the\NPharaoh than Yugi is, right, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.11,0:08:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,So maybe if you concentrate hard enough,\Nyou can figure out what door he's behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.79,0:08:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll try.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.85,0:08:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's worth a shot, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.31,0:09:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.87,0:09:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,But ever since his spirit left the\Npuzzle, I haven't sensed him at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.59,0:09:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Just try, Yug.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.07,0:09:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It may be the only chance we've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.35,0:09:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Pharaoh, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.95,0:09:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all inside the Millennium\NPuzzle, and we're trying to find you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.81,0:09:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Pharaoh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.91,0:09:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.81,0:09:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.63,0:09:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Pharaoh!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.75,0:09:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,it's strange everyone here seems\Nto know me quite well but i have
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.43,0:09:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,no memory of any of them what did\Nall these people mean to me when
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.57,0:09:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,i was pharaoh did i consider them\Nmy friends or were they merely my
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.11,0:09:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,servants pardon me my pharaoh how
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.03,0:09:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,can i help you uh what's his name
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.63,0:09:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Mahad!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.54,0:09:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,My king, please accept my\Napologies for the interruption.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.33,0:09:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But it is not wise for\Nyou to be outside alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.69,0:09:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.15,0:09:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not safe here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.71,0:09:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,We should go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.73,0:10:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, stay close.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.11,0:10:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Especially after today.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.25,0:10:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,One can never be too cautious.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.97,0:10:11.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.39,0:10:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay behind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.87,0:10:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Mana, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.49,0:10:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.40,0:10:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't pay a visit to my oldest friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.65,0:10:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I just miss him, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.01,0:10:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since he's become the new pharaoh,\Nwe haven't been able to talk at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.11,0:10:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It has only been one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.13,0:10:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You're Mana, and you\Nand I grew up together.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.11,0:10:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I know we haven't spoken in a whole\Nday, but you didn't forget me, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.27,0:10:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,After all these years of\Npracticing magic together,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.67,0:10:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, you and I are practically family.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.55,0:10:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course. Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.29,0:10:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You haven't been walking around in the\Ndesert without wearing a hat again,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.11,0:10:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,now have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.21,0:10:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Mana, that is enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.83,0:10:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It is not like it used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.77,0:10:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you not see?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.99,0:11:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,He is the king of Egypt now\Nand does not have time for...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.89,0:11:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,And he does not have time\Nto speak for himself?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.31,0:11:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that why you've been doing\Nall the talking for him?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.25,0:11:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,That is not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.61,0:11:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you get past the guards, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.33,0:11:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, my magic's been improving.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.21,0:11:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not tell me you used\Nyour freezing spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.67,0:11:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,We need them to guard the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.29,0:11:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Oops, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.01,0:11:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I released these.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.11,0:11:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.37,0:11:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Your magic's improving, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.47,0:11:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me try that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.49,0:11:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It's in here somewhere. Just hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.97,0:11:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.07,0:11:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Turning humans into toads,\Ngetting rid of bad breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.19,0:11:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, the freeze spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.19,0:11:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It's good to know I had friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.07,0:11:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps trying to acquire all seven\NMillennium items at once was a bit ambitious.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.59,0:11:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,But no matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.37,0:11:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll come to me in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.25,0:12:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,So for now, I'll focus\Non one in particular.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.19,0:12:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,The Millennium Ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.03,0:12:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I obtain that, the\Nothers will soon follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.79,0:12:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Sleep well, Tharrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.43,0:12:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,The damage looks quite extensive, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.17,0:12:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You will not get away with this, Bakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.15,0:12:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.59,0:12:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.95,0:12:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you here to protect\Nus from that scary guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.45,0:12:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.51,0:12:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise he will not scare anyone again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.13,0:12:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.05,0:12:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,The Millennium Ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.53,0:12:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,How strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.13,0:12:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Akura!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.17,0:12:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Know this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.51,0:12:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall do everything in my power to\Nkeep your darkness far from this kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.87,0:12:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,So tell me,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.05,0:13:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,is everything really going to\Nchange now that you become this big,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.55,0:13:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,important pharaoh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.89,0:13:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,To be honest, it's hard to remember\Nwhat life was like before I was king.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.11,0:13:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You must have a lot on\Nyour mind these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.75,0:13:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.87,0:13:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,But you still have time\Nfor me, right? Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.03,0:13:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Mana, would you...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.69,0:13:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,could you...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.63,0:13:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,tell me more about us?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.77,0:13:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, you're serious, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.81,0:13:27.93,Default,,0,0,0,,This pharaoh thing's made you weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.15,0:13:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Oops, did I say that out loud?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.41,0:13:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.13,0:13:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess now that you're the king of Egypt,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.41,0:13:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to start calling you\Nthings like your highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.11,0:13:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.95,0:13:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! Mahad!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.71,0:13:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You startled me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.55,0:13:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Greetings, Isis.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.31,0:13:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you discovered what the\Nfuture holds for our kingdom?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.81,0:13:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I have not.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.67,0:14:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,My Millennium Necklace\Nhas been acting strangely.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.81,0:14:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.91,0:14:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,So has my ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.97,0:14:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Bakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.27,0:14:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You need not worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.23,0:14:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I have faith that our new pharaoh\Nwill lead us from this darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.57,0:14:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.93,0:14:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Millennium\NNecklace, I beseech thee,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.83,0:14:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,pierce the shadows and show\Nme the light of the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.85,0:14:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.77,0:14:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I see something.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.17,0:14:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, jumbled pieces of events yet to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.55,0:14:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I sense a great evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.55,0:14:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I must tell Mahad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.89,0:14:50.23,Default,,0,0,0,,My pharaoh, rest assured,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.47,0:14:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,the sacred tomb of former king Aknam\NCannon will never be disturbed again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.99,0:14:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,My team of sorcerers is casting a\Nspell to secure its walls as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.85,0:15:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.31,0:15:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.22,0:15:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,but I will believe that tomb is safe from
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.69,0:15:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,intruders once I have\Ntested it for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.13,0:15:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, we've seen what your\Nmagicians in training are capable of.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.47,0:15:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I would say a bit more\Ntraining couldn't hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.87,0:15:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Seto, that's quite enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.45,0:15:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.63,0:15:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck to you, Mahad,\Nand thank you, my king.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.53,0:15:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Mahad, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.44,0:15:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Please take me with you, Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.39,0:15:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been practicing my\Nspells and I can help!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.55,0:15:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back here, mana!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.13,0:15:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid it's too dangerous\Nand you're merely a student.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.15,0:15:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Mahad's top student.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.95,0:15:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I have twice the skills of any\Nmagician he's leading to that tomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.13,0:15:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,My master needs me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.13,0:15:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems to me you underestimate\Nthe skills of your teacher. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.95,0:15:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Mahad is a strong wizard.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.65,0:15:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.87,0:16:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,you would not find a more powerful\Nmagician if you searched the entire world.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.21,0:16:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.73,0:16:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.35,0:16:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What she doesn't know is that\NMahad's true power was so great,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.83,0:16:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,he had to lock a portion of\Nit away for his own safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.13,0:16:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,If he were to release his full ability,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.69,0:16:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Mahad's strength could exceed that of\Nany guardian in the Pharaoh's court.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.79,0:16:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Isis.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.87,0:16:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Mahad! What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.09,0:16:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure you should\Ngo through with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.53,0:16:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,So you were able to read\Nmy future, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.95,0:16:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.86,0:16:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, I would prefer not to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.71,0:16:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Isis, keep an eye on the Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.81,0:16:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Please wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.29,0:16:52.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Just know that in my\Nvision, you do return.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.57,0:16:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.91,0:17:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It has always been my duty\Nto protect you, my Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.81,0:17:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, Mana. Thank you, Prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.97,0:17:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,There you are
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.39,0:17:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me guess My father\Nasked you to look after me
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.51,0:17:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out! Behind you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.93,0:17:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Mahat!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.55,0:17:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,My prince, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.53,0:17:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I am fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.99,0:17:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.45,0:17:35.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget about me. Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.69,0:17:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,No, my prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.93,0:17:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,The future pharaoh needn't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.51,0:17:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You were bit by a snake, and\NI am getting the poison out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.95,0:17:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,If it were the other way around,\Nyou would do the same thing for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.15,0:17:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,And do you know why?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.55,0:17:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Because we are friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.41,0:17:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.41,0:17:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,And someday when I become pharaoh,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.15,0:17:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you will be standing\Nright there by my side, Mahad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.19,0:18:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I would not have it any other way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.53,0:18:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Even as a child, you protected me\Nmore than I could ever protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.61,0:18:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,So know this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.17,0:18:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Wherever destiny may lead me,\NI promise to return that favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.29,0:18:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The Valley of the Kings isn't this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.43,0:18:19.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Quiet back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.77,0:18:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Our orders are to follow Master Mahad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.35,0:18:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I swore I would never do this,\Nbut I do not see any other way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.39,0:18:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,In order to defeat Bakura, I must release\Nthe power I sealed away so long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.31,0:18:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Sacred Millennium Ring, I call upon thee.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.13,0:18:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Unlock the great force I buried here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.07,0:19:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,He's backed himself into a corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.05,0:19:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.13,0:19:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.91,0:19:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Best of luck, Master Mahan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.25,0:19:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess it's just you and me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.39,0:19:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, come out, come out, wherever you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.97,0:19:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, what do we have here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.13,0:19:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Let the festivities commence.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.05,0:19:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I have been waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.43,0:19:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.63,0:19:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo!
